A batch of small, unrelated cleanup items found during PR review of #94 (email verification) —
each too minor to justify its own file, so they're tracked together here. Unlike the grouped-file
convention for a single staged initiative, these entries aren't ordered or dependent on each
other; they're just being scheduled and fixed together on the same branch. Security-relevant
findings from the same review are tracked separately in
`Spec/Bugs/BUGS-email-verification-review-findings.ospec`.

